  "legacy.npc_talk_09": "§dTheresa: §o\"{v0}\"",
  "legacy.npc_talk_10": "§dTheresa: §o\"He wears a mask of swords and calls it a face. When he comes, the Sword of Aeons will sing. What you do with it after is yours to choose — Albion remembers either way.\"",
